OL,3,GNEWSAWatch: Punting from Oxford to
OL,4,ACambridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour students are punting from Oxford
OL,7,Fto Cambridge to raise funds for the
OL,8,FAlzheimer's Society.
OL,10,FTravelling at around 2mph, the group
OL,11,Ffrom St Johns College, Cambridge, say
OL,12,Fthey expect the 200-mile journey to
OL,13,Ftake them about 12 days.
OL,15,FThe journey takes them from Oxford to
OL,16,FBanbury, then to Northampton on the
OL,17,FGrand Union Canal, up to Peterborough
OL,18,Fon the River Nene, and finally to
OL,19,FCambridge via Ely.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
